  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "企業智慧財產權管理",
    "sub_ename": "ENTERPRISE INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY RIGHT MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "在知識經濟時代，企業必須建立智財管理與治理制度，以保護企業創新研發成果，加速轉型升級，提升自身在全球市場的競爭優勢。本課程旨在讓學生了解企業如何進行有效的智財管理以強化創新績效與組織競爭力。",
    "describe_eh": "In knowledge economics era, enterprises need to establish intellectual property management and governance institutions to protect innovation and speed up business transforming and upgrading for enhancing competitive advantage in global markets. This course aims at teaching students to understand how enterprises manage intellectual property for strengthening innovation performance and organizational competitiveness.",
